SUMMARY:AetherNet — Sprint 1: Infra & Firmware Base
DESCRIPTION:Semanas 1-2 — AetherNet — Sprint 1: Infra & Firmware Base\nRF/HU: RNF-1.1/1.2 RF-2.1 RF-3.1\nHito: Docker up + /health 200 + 2× nRF24L01 initialized + isChipConnected=1\n\nBacklogs:\n• DEVOPS-01 Docker Compose FastAPI+PG16+Mosquitto (docker-compose.yml:1) — 2026-08-12 5d\n• DEVOPS-02 Mosquitto ACL aethernet/# + $SYS/# (mosquitto.conf:1 acl.conf:1) — 2026-08-12\n• DEVOPS-03 init.sql 4 tablas + event_metadata fix (models.py:34) — 2026-08-12\n• DEVOPS-04 CI arduino-cli 1.5.1 FQBN mega/uno/esp32 (ci.yml:90) — 2026-08-14 4d\n• DEVOPS-05 RF nRF24L01 ESP32↔UNO isChipConnected=1 (5235a5d 2026-09-01\, testing-rf-sprint1.md:32)\n• MOV-01 Setup MVVM base ServiceLocator+Retrofit+DataStore+StateFlow (f03190b 2026-09-01)\n• EST-01 EMA prototipo Python α=0.2 ema_filter.py:15 bench 531 (a051dd4)\n• PM-01..04 Backlog MoSCoW + Projects 14 + risk R-12/R-13 + gantt Mermaid (PM-04)\n• Deuda 1→2 (29 ago): PM-08 auditoría + DEVOPS-11 secrets.h + DEVOPS-10 pipeline verde\n\nVentana trabajo diaria 10:00-23:00 (split alrededor de clases). Ver bloques diarios.\nClases UTP: LU 18:30 TS683\, MA 18:30 TS6C3\, MI 18:30 TS683 + 20:30 TS4D3\, JU 18:30 TS6C3\, VI 18:30 TS4D3\, SA 08:00 DevOps + 14:00 LowCode\nRepo: github.com/Craos6518/AetherNet-IoT-Autonomous-Rover — branch docs/revision-sprint2-completa@90c5118
LOCATION:Lab UTP + LAN 192.168.1.x / GitHub Projects 14
STATUS:CONFIRMED
