UID:7654b9bccc6a@aethernet.utp
DTSTAMP:20260910T214904Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Bogota:20260826T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Bogota:20260909T230000
SUMMARY:AetherNet — Sprint 2: Domótica & Acceso
DESCRIPTION:Semanas 3-4 — AetherNet — Sprint 2: Domótica & Acceso\nRF/HU: RF-2.2/2.3 HU-01/02 RF-2.1 RNF-2.2\nHito: PIN 1234 → servo 90° LED verde 5s POST 201 + láser→SECURITY: LED rojo 3s\n\nBacklogs:\n• FW-MEGA-CERROJO Keypad 4×4 (30/32/34/36 +22/24/26/28) + MG90S pin9 0°/90° + LED 44/45/46 (config.h:17\, c7ce065)\n• FW-MEGA-LASER KY-008 S8 + LDR 7 INPUT 10k→GND\, CHECK 50ms COOLDOWN 3s laser.cpp (c7ce065 2026-09-07\, test-laser-uno)\n• MOV-02 LedStatusCard 64dp + mapper 5s/10s/1s + poll 5s (eb01fdd 2026-09-07)\n• MOV-03 MqttManager Paho 1.2.5 tcp1883/ws9001 SharedFlow aethernet/# (662ae9f 2026-09-07\, <50ms)\n• MOV-04 PinViewModel throttle 5/60s PinScreen 4×3 aethernet/access/command:70 → SECURITY: (35 tests)\n• DEVOPS-06/07 8 endpoints POST/GET + 21 tests (73cee08 2026-09-07\, openapi 8 ops)\n• DEVOPS-08 .env.example + secrets.h.example + .gitignore:219\n• EST datasets 36.5k (144fda2 2026-09-09: water 31.5k CC BY-SA 4.0 + gesture 5k CC0) + water_turbidity_analysis.py\n• LOW-02 Node-RED DEUDA 2026-09-09 (no deploy) — intrusión vía Telegram directo (intrusion_alert.json ref)\n• Revisión docs 90c5118 2026-09-10 docs/revision-sprint2-completa (sincroniza 13 docs)\n\nVentana trabajo diaria 10:00-23:00 (split alrededor de clases). Ver bloques diarios.\nClases UTP: LU 18:30 TS683\, MA 18:30 TS6C3\, MI 18:30 TS683 + 20:30 TS4D3\, JU 18:30 TS6C3\, VI 18:30 TS4D3\, SA 08:00 DevOps + 14:00 LowCode\nRepo: github.com/Craos6518/AetherNet-IoT-Autonomous-Rover — branch docs/revision-sprint2-completa@90c5118
LOCATION:Lab UTP + LAN 192.168.1.x / GitHub Projects 14
